{"3259110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Remnants of Lumira", "steam_appid": 3259110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remnants of Lumira is a fast paced story-based 3D platformer with a retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a mouse named &quot;Furvolt&quot; unaware of your sense of time, but desperate to find answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanding move set as the story progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique Worlds with their own series of levels and aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging platforming gameplay accommodating for the casual 3d platforming fan, to the most seasoned veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret/multiple endings(?!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a series of levels within 5 Worlds, where you unlock new abilities to better circumnavigate your environments, while also progressing through the story and unlocking new characters throughout your journey!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remnants of Lumira is a fast paced story-based 3D platformer with a retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a mouse named &quot;Furvolt&quot; unaware of your sense of time, but desperate to find answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanding move set as the story progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Unique Worlds with their own series of levels and aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging platforming gameplay accommodating for the casual 3d platforming fan, to the most seasoned veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret/multiple endings(?!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a series of levels within 5 Worlds, where you unlock new abilities to better circumnavigate your environments, while also progressing through the story and unlocking new characters throughout your journey!</p>", "short_description": "An open ended 3D Platformer, with retro graphics, and an expanding moveset. Features 5+ different playable characters across 5 different worlds with a story to complement the route of progression. Geared for both casual and veteran fans of the genre.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259110/ccc99ab47f5f9f8514ba791e41454fba984597f0/header.jpg?t=1762155150", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259110/185f382829b8b960e07d63b1ffdb488f468b76db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762155150", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259110/185f382829b8b960e07d63b1ffdb488f468b76db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762155150", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Tested on Windows 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Tested on Windows 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requireme